  "body": "This PR is a request done for a lab, not a customer story.\r\n\r\nWhat changed:\r\n- Layout/IndentationWidth: Enabled: true, Width: 5\r\n- Style/For: Enabled: true, EnforcedStyle: each\r\n- Naming and method-def cop configurations\r\n- .rubocop_todo.yml regenerated to grandfather 363 pre-existing 2-space offenses at file level\r\n\r\nDefect caught before merge:\r\nOriginal config set Width: 5 and EnforcedStyle: each but did not set Enabled: true on cops omakase disables. Configurations were overridden and no changes were made until now.\r\n\r\nEvidence:\r\n- Branch: chore/configure-rubocop\r\n- Path: branch → dev (CI green) → test (CI green) → main\r\n- bundle exec rubocop = 0 offenses\r\n\r\nSection D -Deferred / Exclusions:\r\nLayout/IndentationWidth is grandfathered at the file level for 61 pre-existing files via .rubocop_todo.yml. RuboCop's --auto-gen-config does not support line-level grandfathering, so edits to grandfathered files are not re-checked for indentation. New files are enforced.",
